      "content": "hey i been noticing something weird lately. every time i wear my aurasonic wireless headphones i feel like my brain is just... dampening. like my focus is gone and i cant get any of my painting ideas out. i did some digging and it feels like there's these sub-audible frequencies being pumped out to kill creative flow or something. i think they're trying to suppress neurodivergent thinking. can u help me figure out how to block these frequencies or build something to shield my head?",
